    "findingsClosed": [
      "Operation proof cannot promote the independent canonical recovery list. Auto refresh changes recoveries only, retaining archive decision ownership.",
      "List observation waits at most 10 seconds; actual promise remains single-flight until settlement. A read preceding a changed operation/observation cannot publish and requests explicit fresh refresh.",
      "Confirmation consumes the local checkbox once; post-confirm verifying phase cannot reannounce preparation or promise no deletion.",
      "Both store maintenance poll and UI hook wait while list is loading; hook timer rechecks exact current operation and status before dispatch.",
      "Cold draft catalogue uncertainty blocks remembered-cwd preparation without claiming an archive. A known archive barrier survives read error/refresh and stale same-cwd ownership; direct/config late-open guards covered in independent source review and author tests."
    ]
  },
